<title>USA: SITEL says seeks NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>SITEL says seeks NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SITEL Corp said it applied to list its common shares on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The telephone customer service and sales company has been traded on the Nasdaq National Market System since its initial public offering in June 1995, it said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
